-- Every Script is an actor with a mailbox. `send … to me` queues a message
-- and goes on; `and wait` suspends until the answer comes back in `it`.
on review order
  if the amount of order > 1000 then return "needs a human"
  return "approved"
end review

on main
  send review with {amount: 50} to me and wait
  say "small order: " & it
  send review with {amount: 5000} to me and wait
  say "large order: " & it
end main
